# Signing secret for Resend's delivery webhooks (bounces, complaints). Resend →
# Webhooks → Add endpoint → https://<your domain>/api/webhooks/resend, then copy
# the endpoint's signing secret (starts with whsec_). Unset → the endpoint
# refuses every request, and bounces are simply not recorded.
# RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET="whsec_..."
